                                       "This is your final year, and the work you do now prepares you for WAEC and NECO. First Term covers logarithms, logic, surds and trigonometry, matrices, simultaneous equations, spheres, latitude and longitude, binary operations and arithmetic of finance. Many of these topics appear in every Mathematics paper.",
